      },
      "2": {
        "name": "latent",
        "tooltip": "Video latent with the generated keyframes stripped."
      },
      "3": {
        "name": "keyframes",
        "tooltip": "The peeled keyframes, labeled with generated_keyframe_indices and generated_keyframe_num_frames. Feed these to a later Add Generated Keyframes to initialize new slots, or to Generated Keyframes To Guides to pin them as frozen image guides (indices are remapped if the canvas length changed)."
